          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ঢেকে যাওয়া — ḍheke jāoyā — \"to be covered over; to be shrouded\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "কুয়াশায় পুরো গ্রামটা ঢেকে গেল। kuyāshāy puro grāmṭā ḍheke gelô. The whole village was shrouded in fog."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he/she …): সেই পাহাড় মেঘে ঢেকে গেল, sei pāhāṛ meghe ḍheke gelô."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ঢেকে is the -এ form of ঢাকা, to cover: what covers takes -এ, কুয়াশায়, মেঘে."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ঢেকে যাওয়া (ḍheke jāoyā) joins ঢেকে, the -এ form of ঢাকা, \"to cover\", which CDIAL lists as Bengali ḍhākā under the reconstructed ḍhakk, \"cover\" (CDIAL 5574), to যাওয়া, to go: to go under a cover."
            }
          ]
        },
